PROBLEM STATEMENT ; 
-Develop a C++ program to represent an electric vehicle charging network using a graph, where charging stations are 
represented as vertices and connections between stations are represented as edges.

-The program should accept a user-defined starting vertex and perform the following modifications in a 
single program:

*>Modification A: Accept a different starting vertex and display the DFS traversal order.
*>Modification B: Display all vertices reachable from the starting vertex and identify unvisited or unreachable vertices.
*>Modification C: Count the reachable vertices and display their BFS levels, indicating the minimum number of
connections required to reach each station from the starting station.
